menu "Balabala diagnostics"
    config BALABALA_AUTOTEST
        bool "Unattended isolated diagnostic"
        default n
        help
            Fixed phase 1 learning/storage or phase 2 BLE script with exclusive SD root.
            Phase 2 uses RAM Wi-Fi storage and never restarts. No ROM script.
            Diagnostic images are not delivery images.
    config BALABALA_AUTOTEST_PHASE
        int "Diagnostic phase"
        depends on BALABALA_AUTOTEST
        range 1 2
        default 1
    config BALABALA_MEMORY_DIAGNOSTICS
        bool "Log memory at application stage boundaries"
        default n
        help
            Samples INTERNAL|8BIT free/minimum/largest block and the main task
            stack watermark. Largest-block and watermark queries scan memory;
            enable only for diagnosis. Stage samples can miss transient peaks.
            Rust allocation failure records these values regardless of this flag.
endmenu
